@Priority Run W-1 first, then W-2, then W-3. All three write the same index.html, so they run one at a time under a single file lock. W-2 and W-3 wait on their dependencies. Please check W-1's envelope (35 money, 2 calls, 20 min, 1 retry). Rule: Dependency order first, then lowest workflow id. One writer on index.html at a time (file lock)..
HOLD W-2: W1-core-page (W-1) must be done and pass its completion check; index.html lock must be free
HOLD W-3: W2-menu (W-2) must be done and pass its completion check, since the form reads the menu data array; index.html lock must be free
